(7671009, 1252179, 173844, '<td valign="top">Enchanting scene, with birch trunks like rays of sunlight and a filigree of vegetation, green and gold.  Beautifully balanced both in color and composition.  The artistry seems generated in itself rather through purposeful filtration.  Not to say it is unprocessed, but rather modestly so.  The stream wending through the lower left is the distinction that endows the photograph with imaginative depth and beckons the viewer forward.  Nice to breathe deeply in here a while.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Enchanting scene, with birch trunks like rays of sunlight and a filigree of vegetation, green and gold.  Beautifully balanced both in color and composition.  The artistry seems generated in itself rather through purposeful filtration.  Not to say it is unprocessed, but rather modestly so.  The stream wending through the lower left is the distinction that endows the photograph with imaginative depth and beckons the viewer forward.  Nice to breathe deeply in here a while.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-07-28 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
